{"content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap\");\n.arcadia-sourcing{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;direction:ltr;}\n.hero-sourcing{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0d0d,#1a1a1a,#001a0a);color:#fff;padding:80px 20px;text-align:center;}\n.hero-sourcing h1{font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#c9a84c;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.hero-sourcing p{font-size:1.1rem;color:#ddd;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 30px;}\n.btn-wa{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;margin-top:20px;}\n.section{padding:60px 20px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}\n.section-title{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px;}\n.section-title span{color:#c9a84c;}\n.products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;}\n.product-card{background:#fff;border:2px solid #f0e6cc;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 18px;text-align:center;}\n.product-card h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.product-card p{color:#666;font-size:.9rem;}\n.price-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;}\n.price-table th{background:#c9a84c;color:#fff;padding:12px;text-align:center;}\n.price-table td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;text-align:center;}\n.price-table tr:nth-child(even){background:#fdf8ee;}\n.faq{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;}\n.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;padding:16px 0;}\n.faq-q{font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.faq-a{color:#555;line-height:1.7;}\n.cta-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a1a,#001a0a);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;}\n.cta-box h2{color:#c9a84c;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;}\n.cta-box p{color:#ddd;margin-bottom:24px;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"arcadia-sourcing\">\n<div class=\"hero-sourcing\">\n<h1>🏠 Import Home Appliances & Electronics from China</h1>\n<p>Home appliances and electronics from <a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/china-main-en/\">China</a>'s largest factories — high quality, on-site inspection, wholesale prices.</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20home%20appliances%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a><span class=\"arc-local-office-phone\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:15px;\">Arcadia WhatsApp: <span dir=\"ltr\">+7 706 400 7561</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Available <span>Products</span></h2>\n<div class=\"products-grid\">\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>❄️ Air Conditioning & Cooling</h3><p>Split AC units, fans, air coolers</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🍳 Kitchen & Cooking</h3><p>Pots, cookware, electric kitchen appliances</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🔌 Home Electronics</h3><p>Chargers, power panels, extensions, UPS</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>💡 LED Lighting</h3><p>LED bulbs, panel lights, light strips</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🛋️ Home Furniture</h3><p>Chairs, tables, shelves, home decor</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>🏗️ Building Materials</h3><p>Ceramic tiles, bathroom fixtures, bulk building materials</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Approximate <span>Prices</span></h2>\n<table class=\"price-table\">\n<tr><th>Product</th><th>Min. Quantity</th><th>Approx. Price</th><th>Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td>LED Bulbs 9W</td><td>200 pcs</td><td>/bin/bash.8–.5/pc</td><td>E27/B22</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ceiling Fans</td><td>30 pcs</td><td>8–5/pc</td><td>With/without remote</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mirror Steel Pot Sets</td><td>50 sets</td><td>2–0/set</td><td>5–7 pcs/set</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Multi-port USB Chargers</td><td>100 pcs</td><td>–/pc</td><td>PD/QC3</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Do the appliances support local voltage (220V)?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes, we specify the required voltage (220V/50Hz) to the supplier so all goods arrive ready for your region.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Is there a warranty on the appliances?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">We inspect goods on-site before shipping. Factory warranty ranges from 6–24 months depending on the product.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Can we put our logo on the products?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes, Private Label service is available for most products from specified minimum quantities.</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cta-box\">\n<h2>Start Importing with Ease 🏠</h2>\n<p>Message us with the product, quantity, and budget and we will connect you with the best supplier</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20home%20appliances%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "_elementor_data": ""}